    "detailed_description": "In a misty forest, you play as a hungry zombie, you constantly run, must catch up with humans to fuel to survive, careful not to run into your own kind.<br />\r\nThe forest is littered with gold coins, which can be collected for points to increase your maximum health.<br />\r\nBlue items like lightning symbols can increase your running speed for a short time.However, be aware that each time you use this item, you will lose a piece of body, and using too much will directly cause the game to fail.<br />\r\nThe Red Cross item restores some of your health.<br />\r\nWhite clockwork shaped item  can pause time around and stop nearby humans.<br />\r\nPink lollipop shaped item can confuse surrounding humans and make them run back.<br />\r\nThe green skull-shaped item allows you to turn into a ghost for a short time, ignoring the trees.<br />\r\nEnjoy the endless chase.",
